            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2302] Add info level logging when installing node modules and bundling</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2302</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Add info level logging when installing node modules and bundling helium packages. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Because your doesn&apos;t get noticed during 30secs ~ few minutes at all. This is usually case if you have multiple enabled helium packages. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;User might think that Zeppelin hangs or there is other problem If there is no log message.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
